## Phone calls beat clicks (locked · Kate 09/28/2026)

Rank keep / pause / “winner” in this order:

1. Phones · Call details and Campaign Phone calls · total calls · then answered vs missed · then cost per call
2. Clicks · second priority · Kate 09/28/2026 · people may convert on the website or call the firm directly outside tracked Ads phones
3. CTR / Eligible spend / impression share · never outrank phones or meaningful clicks

Phones still beat clicks when they conflict. Do not keep a high-spend low-phone term only because it clicks if phones and site path are both weak. Do not treat zero-phone click volume as worthless by itself · it can be real demand via site or direct dial.

Forbidden: calling a keyword, RSA, AG, or geo a winner on Eligible spend or impressions alone while phones and clicks are both thin. That is how PO Phrases stayed Enabled as “winners” while bleeding DV.

